7Aren’t❓ they🫂 also💯 insulting🗣️ the✨ good✨ name📛 you🫵 carry🫂?
8You🫵 do💯 well💯 if⚠️ you🫵 follow👣 Scripture📜’s👑 royal👑 law📜: “Love💛 your👥 neighbor🫂 as➡️ yourself🫵.”
9But⚡ if⚠️ you🫵 play🎭 favorites🚫, you🫵 sin💔 and➡️ the📜 law📜 calls📣 you🫵 out⬆️ as➡️ lawbreakers🚫—ìdájọ́🇳🇬.
10Anyone👤 who🙏 follows👣 the💯 whole💯 law📜 but⚡ breaks💔 even⚡ one☝️ part📍 is💯 accountable⚖️ for➡️ it🫵 all💯.
11The👑 One👑 who🙏 said🗣️, “Don’t🚫 commit💔 adultery💔,” also💯 said🗣️, “Don’t🚫 murder🔪.” So➡️ even⚡ if⚠️ you🫵 don’t🚫 commit💔 adultery💔 but⚡ do💔 murder🔪, you🫵 have💯 broken💔 God’s👑 law📜.
12Speak🗣️ and➡️ act💪 as➡️ people🫂 who🙏 will🔜 be💯 judged⚖️ by🙏 the📜 law📜 that➡️ sets🕊️ people🫂 free🕊️.
13God’s👑 judgment⚖️ is💯 merciless🚫 toward➡️ people🫂 who🙏 show🚫 no🚫 mercy💛. But⚡ mercy💛 wins🏆 against➡️ judgment⚖️—raḥma🕌.
14Family🫂, what❓ good✨ is💯 it🫵 if⚠️ someone👤 claims🗣️ faith🙏 but⚡ never🚫 acts💪 on📍 it🫵? Can💭 that👆 kind🧩 of🙏 faith🙏 save🛟 them🫂?
